  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Piku is a Piku Finance/PikuDAO yield-optimized stablecoin and global yield gateway. Its purpose should be described around providing access to optimized stablecoin yield and related Piku product contracts, while distinguishing those product contracts from any upstream Inverter framework components. Pendle should not be described as the core protocol unless independently evidenced as an integration or held position.",
